// CM1 — Anglais — niveau 4 (exigeant)
$CATEGORY: CM1/Anglais/Niveau 4

::Present simple::He {=plays} football every Saturday. (play)

::Negative::Comment dit-on « Je n'aime pas les carottes » ?{=I don't like carrots. ~I not like carrots. ~I doesn't like carrots. ~I am not like carrots.}

::There are::There {=are} two cats in the garden. (is ou are ?)

::Questions::Associez chaque question à la bonne réponse.{
=Where do you live? -> I live in Brest.
=What's your favourite colour? -> It's blue.
=How are you? -> I'm fine, thank you.
=Have you got a pet? -> Yes, I've got a dog.
}

::Opposites::Quel est le contraire de « big » ?{=small ~tall ~long ~old}

::Ordinal::Comment dit-on « le premier » en anglais ?{=the first ~the one ~the last ~the second}

::Does::{=Does} she like music? (Do ou Does ?)

::Seasons::Écrivez en anglais la saison « hiver ».{=winter}
